{"title":"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems\">2004 AMC 12B #5</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 10B Problems\">2004 AMC 10B #7</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On a trip from the United States to Canada, Isabella took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> U.S. dollars. At the border she exchanged them all, receiving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> Canadian dollars for every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> U.S. dollars. After spending <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> Canadian dollars, she had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> Canadian dollars left. What is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/38345dcb3c2188a9dda01f754bcb8851cf0f0470.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ }5\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)\\ }6\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)\\ }7\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)\\ }8\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)\\ }9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"344\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Isabella had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/f/cbf8f6d185e42517ebb3ce1e8a413551e574dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> Canadian dollars. Setting up an equation we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/9/2a9f6b4df4d9145f06844aacd24da080f19c2a63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=\\frac{7}{10}\\cdot(60+d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"135\" height=\"38\" />, which solves to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/809c0ab0396cae6ff518c1ce44ba7ef31a23c84d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />, and the sum of digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c5665acc0fb699f4e577951081cba2407c18434f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each time Isabella exchanges <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> U.S. dollars, she gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> Canadian dollars and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> Canadian dollars extra. Isabella received a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> Canadian dollars extra, therefore she exchanged <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> U.S. dollars <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/3171af0cdc5e30f6097c4ad2ec154a394207120e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{3}=20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" /> times. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/4/5d463c37df04b073ebff72b7d6bc582ae8c7721e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=7\\cdot20=140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" />, and the sum of the digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c5665acc0fb699f4e577951081cba2407c18434f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Isabella started with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars and ended with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars. Therefore,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/1/7f19c1810085fb816f7de27585685d3359f0017f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d}{7}\\cdot10-60=d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e38a37e23df9f71c6060bd41473fd31420fa9cc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c5665acc0fb699f4e577951081cba2407c18434f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WVK4SZAoD5E\">https://youtu.be/WVK4SZAoD5E</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B\">2004 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.p